#N canvas 199 292 462 287 description 0;
#X text 10 7 This patch consists of experimental rhythms that generate
different sound patterns. The patterns can be changed by playing around
with the values of the oscillator and phasor. The rhythms can be also
visualized in order to observe their impact and structure. Along with
the sound patterns \, the patch includes a recording that sonically
represents the peace/harmony within the chaos. When the spacebar is
pressed \, the recording plays \; otherwise it should stop (I hope
it does on your PC as my keyboard has some issues). The tempo of the
recording was modulated a bit to add a more experimental and playful
touch to the overall result. Additionally \, I have included a pitch
tracker to respond to the sounds received from our environment.;
